{"symbol":"DOKA.SW","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-16T19:18:39Z","info":{"address1":"Hofwisenstrasse 24","city":"Rümlang","zip":"8153","country":"Switzerland","phone":"41 44 818 9011","website":"https://www.dormakaba.com","industry":"Building Products & Equipment","industryKey":"building-products-equipment","industryDisp":"Building Products & Equipment","sector":"Industrials","sectorKey":"industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","longBusinessSummary":"dormakaba Holding AG provides access and security solutions worldwide. It offers door hardware products, including door closers, locks, fittings, emergency exits, and panic hardware; interior glass systems comprising manual sliding, manual single and double action door, fittings for glass assemblies, and horizontal sliding walls; and entrance systems, such as swing operators, automatic sliding doors, sliding door operators, revolving doors, security revolving doors and interlocks, connectivity, sensor barriers and speed gates, and turnstiles. The company also provides mechanical key systems, including cylinder locks with reversible keys, master key systems, planning and maintenance; electronic access and data comprising electronic cylinders, electronic door locks, digital door locks, card readers and peripherals, electromagnetic locks, and time and attendance; lodging systems that include access management systems, electronic hotel locks, digital wallets, and perimeter access; and safe locks under the Axessor Appex Series, Axxesor, Paxos, Cencon, CenconX, Auditcon, LA GARD electronic, Mauer electronic, Mauer mechanical, LA GARD mechanical, X-0 series brands. In addition, it offers access control, accessibility, fire protection, hygiene and infection prevention, mobile access, people flow and security, touch-free access, and automatic door systems solutions. The company serves the airport, healthcare, hospitality, multihousing, datacenters, rail, office, residential, and utilities industries. dormakaba Holding AG was founded in 1862 and is headquartered in Rümlang, Switzerland.","fullTimeEmployees":15347,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Dr. Till  Reuter","age":57,"title":"Chief Executive Officer","yearBorn":1968,"fiscalYear":2026,"totalPay":2335000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Rene  Peter","age":58,"title":"Chief Financial Officer","yearBorn":1967,"fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Carsten  Franke","age":60,"title":"Chief operations Officer","yearBorn":1965,"fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Swetlana Iodko Schoordijk","title":"Head of Investor Relations","fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Dr. Patrick  Grawehr","age":61,"title":"General Counsel","yearBorn":1964,"fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Nikola  Faulkner","title":"Chief Human Resources Officer","fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Stephen  Bewick","age":59,"title":"Chief Commercial Officer","yearBorn":1966,"fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Dr. Christian  Baur","age":55,"title":"President of Key & Wall Solutions and OEM and Chief Transformation Officer","yearBorn":1970,"fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. David  Fuller","age":53,"title":"Chief Innovation Officer","yearBorn":1972,"fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"auditRisk":1,"boardRisk":2,"compensationRisk":2,"shareHolderRightsRisk":1,"overallRisk":1,"governanceEpochDate":1793491200,"compensationAsOfEpochDate":1798675200,"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"priceHint":2,"previousClose":69.1,"open":68.9,"dayLow":68.2,"dayHigh":69.5,"regularMarketPreviousClose":69.1,"regularMarketOpen":68.9,"regularMarketDayLow":68.2,"regularMarketDayHigh":69.5,"dividendRate":0.95,"dividendYield":1.37,"exD